  "body": "VENDOR WANTS THIS SOLD — ALL GENUINE OFFERS CONSIDERED\r\n\r\nImagine building your dream home in one of Gulf Harbour's sought-after gated communities, enjoying beautiful coastal scenery, privacy and the freedom to create a home tailored to your lifestyle.\r\nThis generous 968 m² freehold section at 4 Palm View Terrace offers an exciting opportunity to secure a substantial, completely flat building site in prestigious Pacific Cliffs.\r\nA rare combination of views and space\r\nEnjoy the outlook towards the ocean on the eastern side and marina views to the west. With a well-considered two-storey design, you may be able to make the most of these stunning coastal outlooks from your main living areas and master bedroom.\r\nThe flat section offers an appealing starting point for your building plans, with room to explore a spacious family home, generous outdoor living areas and potentially a pool, subject to design and applicable approvals.\r\nWhy this property deserves your attention\r\n•\t968 m² of flat land — a generous canvas for your dream home.\r\n•\tOcean and marina outlooks — two distinctive aspects of Gulf Harbour's coastal lifestyle.\r\n•\tPrestigious gated community — enjoy the private setting of Pacific Cliffs.\r\n•\tPrivate-road ownership interest — the property includes a share in the community's private road.\r\n•\tClose to Wentworth College and Wentworth Primary — convenient for families who value access to private schooling.\r\n•\tFuture transport connectivity — Penlink is under construction and will improve the connection between the Whangaparaoa Peninsula and State Highway 1. It is expected to reduce peak-hour travel times towards Auckland central, making Gulf Harbour an increasingly attractive option for buyers seeking a coastal lifestyle.\r\n•\tHouse-design inspiration— an example is attached to help you visualise the possibilities.\r\n\r\nMake your vision a reality\r\nWhether you dream of a contemporary coastal retreat, a substantial family home or a home designed around entertaining and outdoor living, this section gives you the opportunity to create something special.\r\nThe vendor is motivated to sell and is prepared to consider offers below the current council rating valuation of NZ$870,000.\r\nDon't let this opportunity pass you by.\r\nContact the owner directly for further information, to discuss an offer or to arrange a viewing.\r\nPrice: By negotiation — genuine offers invited. Contact owner 021688610\r\n\r\nPlease conduct your own due diligence regarding title, covenants, easements etc.",
